.TH SDL_GetTextureAlphaMod 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetTextureAlphaMod \- Get the additional alpha value multiplied into render copy operations.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_render.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_GetTextureAlphaMod(SDL_Texture *texture, Uint8 *alpha);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I texture
the texture to query\[char46]
.TP
.I alpha
a pointer filled in with the current alpha value\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should only be called on the main thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

